    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέργειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>above ground,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρωγλοδυτικός,</span> of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				488a24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				10.18.8
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόγειος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
