					Vett.Val.
					98.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑ. ἡμισφαίριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
